  warning (committable-hook): /home/dev/app/.githooks/pre-push is inside the working tree, not inside /home/dev/app/.git, so git can track it. Committing it publishes an upload hook that runs for everyone who checks the repository out and adopts that hooks directory, and it carries this machine's absolute paths. Add it to .gitignore or .git/info/exclude if you meant this hook to stay yours.
